-- TOP-01
#ASSERT (`the benefit position for` spsB `, applicant` spA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` baseS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (`Rate facts` OF 0, `Income Test 1`, 250, 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 5 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `entitled` AND (`the benefit position for` spsB `, applicant` spA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` baseS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (`Rate facts` OF 0, `Income Test 1`, 250, 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 5 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `weekly rate` EQUALS 494.52 AND (`the benefit position for` spsB `, applicant` spA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` baseS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (`Rate facts` OF 0, `Income Test 1`, 250, 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 5 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `commences on` EQUALS JUST (Date 8 3 2027)
-- TOP-02
#ASSERT (`the benefit position for` jsB `, applicant` baseA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (jsR 400) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 20 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `entitled` AND (`the benefit position for` jsB `, applicant` baseA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (jsR 400) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 20 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `weekly rate` EQUALS 210 AND (`the benefit position for` jsB `, applicant` baseA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (jsR 400) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 20 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `commences on` EQUALS JUST (Date 20 3 2027)
-- TOP-03
#ASSERT (`the benefit position for` `supported living payment for restricted work capacity or total blindness` `, applicant` slA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` baseL `, rate facts` (`Rate facts` OF 420, `Income Test 1`, 0, 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 10 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `entitled` AND (`the benefit position for` `supported living payment for restricted work capacity or total blindness` `, applicant` slA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` baseL `, rate facts` (`Rate facts` OF 420, `Income Test 1`, 0, 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 10 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `weekly rate` EQUALS 420 AND (`the benefit position for` `supported living payment for restricted work capacity or total blindness` `, applicant` slA `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` baseL `, rate facts` (`Rate facts` OF 420, `Income Test 1`, 0, 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 10 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `commences on` EQUALS JUST (Date 8 3 2027)
-- TOP-04
#ASSERT NOT (`the benefit position for` jsB `, applicant` (barA `a temporary entry class visa holder` FALSE) `, jobseeker facts` baseJ `, sole parent facts` dummyS `, supported living facts` dummyL `, rate facts` (jsR 0) `, commencement facts` (`Commencement facts` OF d0, NOTHING, (Date 5 3 2027), 7, FALSE, TRUE))'s `entitled`
